retv-bridge-samsung: third-party attributions

Apps2Samsung (https://github.com/Apps2Samsung/Apps2Samsung)
src/certs.rs and src/csr.rs port the Samsung certificate flow of its
Apps2Samsung.Core/Certificate/TizenCertificateService.cs and CertificateEndpoints.cs:
the service endpoints, form fields, certificate request subjects and extensions,
and the choice of Samsung CA after each certificate. ca/vd_tizen_dev_author_ca.txt
and ca/vd_tizen_dev_public2.txt are Samsung's public CA certificates, the same
bytes as Apps2Samsung's TizenProfile/ca/*.cer|crt and Samsung's Tizen certificate
extension.

